 "It creates an electric charge by rubbing its feathers together. It dances over to its enemies and delivers shocking electrical punches.": "羽をこすりあわせて電気をおこす。おどるように敵へ近づき電撃のパンチをたたきこむ。",
 "It extends the duration of the area-altering moves used by the holder.": "持たせると地形を変化させるわざの効果がつづくターンがのびる。",
 "It forms a group of Rattata, which it assumes command of. Each group has its own territory, and disputes over food happen often.": "コラッタのむれをつくりそのボスとしてしたがえる。むれごとになわばりがあり食べものをめぐるあらそいがたえない。",
 "It goads its enemies into attacking, withstands the hits, and in return, delivers a headbutt, crushing their bones with its rocky mane.": "敵をおこらせてこうげきをさそい受けとめたあと岩のたてがみで頭突きをくらわせ骨をくだく。",
 "It knows the swamp it lives in like no other and blends in perfectly. It's more timid than its regular counterpart, and doesn't like showing itself to bypassers.": "すみかのぬまをだれよりもよく知りみごとにとけこむ。ふつうのすがたより臆病で通りすがりの人にすがたを見せたがらない。",
 "It lives on snowy mountains. Its steel shell is very hard—so much so, it can't roll its body up into a ball.": "雪山にすんでいる。はがねのからはとてもかたく体をまるめてころがることができない。",
 "It looks down on everyone other than itself. Its preferred tactics are sucker punches and blindside attacks.": "自分いがいのすべてを見下している。不意打ちや死角からのこうげきをこのむ。",
 "It summons the dead with its dreamy dancing. From their malice, it draws power with which to curse its enemies.": "夢見るようなおどりで死者をよびよせる。その悪意から力をえて敵をのろうのだ。",
 "It uses psychokinesis to control electricity. It hops aboard its own tail, using psychic power to lift the tail and move about while riding it.": "ねんりきで電気をあやつる。サイコパワーでうかせたしっぽの上に乗りそのまま移動していく。",
 "Its head sports an altered form of whiskers made of metal. When in communication with its comrades, its whiskers wobble to and fro.": "頭には金属でできたヒゲのようなものが生えている。仲間とれんらくをとるときヒゲがゆらゆらとゆれる。",
 "Its sharp fangs make short work of finishing off its enemies, but it's unable to maintain this body indefinitely. After a period of time, it falls apart.": "するどいキバであっという間に敵をしとめるがこの体をながく保つことはできない。時がたつとくずれ落ちてしまう。",
