 "The bones it possesses were once its mother's. Its mother's regrets have become like a vengeful spirit protecting this Pokémon.": "持っている骨はかつて母親のものだった。母のむねんが亡霊となってこのポケモンをまもっている。",
 "The crystals on Grimer's body are lumps of toxins. If one falls off, lethal poisons leak out.": "ベトベターの体の結晶は毒のかたまり。ひとつでも落ちると猛毒がもれだしてしまう。",
 "The light pouring out from all over its body affects living things and nature, impacting them in various ways.": "全身からあふれだす光は生きものにも自然にもさまざまなえいきょうをあたえる。",
 "The opponent Pokémon cannot escape.": "相手のポケモンをにげられなくする。",
 "The user breathes a stream of intense fire toward the target with the full force of its Z-Power.": "Zパワーのすべてをこめてはげしい炎を相手にふきつけて攻撃する。",
 "The user controls the target with its Z-Power and hurts the target with full force.": "Zパワーで相手をあやつり全力できずつけて攻撃する。",
 "The user gathers dark energy using its Z-Power and sucks the target into it.": "Zパワーで暗黒のエネルギーをあつめ相手をのみこんで攻撃する。",
 "The user materializes its aura using its Z-Power and attacks the target with full force.": "Zパワーでオーラを実体化させ全力で相手を攻撃する。",
 "The user rams an energy orb created by its Z-Power into the target with full force.": "Zパワーでつくりだしたエネルギーのかたまりを全力で相手にぶつけて攻撃する。",
 "The user soars up with its Z-Power and plummets toward the target at full speed.": "Zパワーで空高くまいあがり全速力で相手にとびこんで攻撃する。",
 "The user summons a huge rock mountain using its Z-Power and drops it onto the target with full force.": "Zパワーで巨大な岩山をよびだし全力で相手にたたきつけて攻撃する。",
 "The user, Alolan Raichu, attacks the target with full force and leaves it with paralysis.": "アローラライチュウが全力で相手を攻撃しまひ状態にする。",
 "The user, Decidueye, creates countless arrows and shoots the target with full force.": "ジュナイパーが無数の矢をつくりだし全力で相手を射ぬく。",
 "The user, Eevee, gets energy from its evolved friends and boosts all of its stats sharply.": "イーブイが進化した仲間から力をもらいすべての能力をぐーんと上げる。",
 "The user, Incineroar, strengthens its body and crashes into the target with full force.": "ガオガエンが体をきたえあげ全力で相手にぶつかって攻撃する。",
 "The user, Kommo-o, attacks the opposing Pokémon with full force and boosts all of its stats.": "ジャラランガが全力で相手を攻撃しすべての能力を上げる。",
 "The user, Lunala, attacks the target with full force. This move ignores the target's Ability.": "ルナアーラが全力で相手を攻撃する。相手の特性の効果を受けない。",
 "The user, Lycanroc, attacks the target with full force and negates the effect on the battlefield.": "ルガルガンが全力で相手を攻撃し戦場にかかった効果を打ち消す。",
 "The user, Marshadow, punches and kicks the target consecutively with full force.": "マーシャドーがパンチとキックを全力で相手に連続でたたきこむ。",
 "The user, Mew, attacks the target with full force and charges the terrain with psychic energy.": "ミュウが全力で相手を攻撃し場をサイコパワーでみたす。",
 "The user, Mimikyu, punches the target with full force.": "ミミッキュが全力で相手をなぐりつけて攻撃する。",
 "The user, Primarina, summons a massive amount of water and attacks the target with full force.": "アシレーヌが大量の水をよびだし全力で相手を攻撃する。",
 "The user, Snorlax, moves its enormous body energetically and attacks the target with full force.": "カビゴンが巨体をはげしく動かし全力で相手を攻撃する。",
 "The user, Solgaleo, attacks the target with full force. This move ignores the target's Ability.": "ソルガレオが全力で相手を攻撃する。相手の特性の効果を受けない。",
 "Therian Forme": "れいじゅうフォルム",
 "They eat rocks and often get into a scrap over them. The shock of Graveler smashing together causes a flash of light and a booming noise.": "岩を食べうばいあいのけんかをよくおこす。ゴローンどうしがぶつかりあうと光がはじけ大きな音がひびく。",
 "This Oricorio relaxes by swaying gently. This increases its psychic energy, which it then fires at its enemies.": "ゆったりとゆれることで心をおちつかせる。高まったサイコパワーを敵にうちだすのだ。",
 "This Pokémon's steel spikes are sheathed in ice. Stabs from these spikes cause deep wounds and severe frostbite as well.": "はがねのトゲは氷につつまれている。さされると深い傷をおうだけでなくひどい凍傷にもなってしまう。",
 "This is Zygarde's form at times when it uses its overwhelming power to suppress those who endanger the ecosystem.": "生態系をおびやかす者をあっとうてきな力でおさえこむときのジガルデのすがた。",
 "This is its form while it is devouring the light of Solgaleo. It pounces on foes and then slashes them with the claws on its four limbs and back.": "ソルガレオの光をむさぼっているすがた。敵にとびかかり四肢と背中のツメで切りさく。",
 "This is its form while it's devouring the light of Lunala. It grasps foes in its giant claws and rips them apart with brute force.": "ルナアーラの光をむさぼっているすがた。巨大なツメで敵をつかみ力ずくで引きさく。",
 "This move uses Attack or Sp. Atk-whichever is higher-of the user, Necrozma, and ignores the target's Ability.": "ネクロズマの攻撃と特攻の高いほうで計算して攻撃する。相手の特性の効果を受けない。",
